      "card_ids": ["C05","C09","C19","C23","C02","C12","C17","C21"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "C41's statement that one-third of tilidine is systemically available is ambiguous and conflicts with direct tilidine F values of 3–7.6%; it does not overturn the low prediction.",
